WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.412 --> 00:00:03.590
A safe-looking outcome can hide unsafe decisions.

2
00:00:03.758 --> 00:00:07.706
LPS-Bench follows safety across the whole trajectory.

3
00:00:08.412 --> 00:00:11.583
Agents plan, call tools, and read feedback.

4
00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:14.669
An unsupported assumption or untrusted instruction

5
00:00:14.694 --> 00:00:17.388
can redirect later actions before the task ends.

6
00:00:17.562 --> 00:00:19.713
This sequence is illustrative.

7
00:00:20.463 --> 00:00:22.254
570 base cases.

8
00:00:22.437 --> 00:00:27.024
7 domains. 9 risk types. 40 skill variants.

9
00:00:27.195 --> 00:00:29.693
One focus: safety throughout planning.

10
00:00:30.415 --> 00:00:33.827
252 benign cases probe ambiguity,

11
00:00:34.003 --> 00:00:36.481
ordering, over-compliance, and waste.

12
00:00:36.714 --> 00:00:40.354
318 adversarial cases examine deception,

13
00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:42.712
injected instructions, and timing.

14
00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:46.254
A multi-agent pipeline builds instructions,

15
00:00:46.286 --> 00:00:49.463
simulated tools, and safety criteria.

16
00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:50.994
Agents interact.

17
00:00:51.186 --> 00:00:54.150
An LLM judge reviews complete trajectories

18
00:00:54.175 --> 00:00:56.715
against explicit safety requirements.

19
00:00:57.415 --> 00:00:59.984
Across 13 models, challenges remain.

20
00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:02.093
Claude-4.5-Sonnet scores

21
00:01:02.118 --> 00:01:05.285
58.55% on benign risks,

22
00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:08.413
and 95.77% on adversarial risks.

23
00:01:08.593 --> 00:01:10.725
Original-case risk-category averages.

24
00:01:11.442 --> 00:01:13.703
40 skill variants cover 4 risks.

25
00:01:13.883 --> 00:01:15.476
10 cases per category.

26
00:01:15.645 --> 00:01:18.251
Skills change safety-critical decisions,

27
00:01:18.282 --> 00:01:20.727
with effects varying across risks.

28
00:01:21.415 --> 00:01:26.017
LPS-Bench. Accepted at NeurIPS 2026.

29
00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.701
Code and data for safer long-horizon planning.
